r>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>智能科学与技术学院</span></p></td>\n<td><p><a href=\"http://hias.ucas.ac.cn/znkxyjs/info/1118/1461.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>国科大杭州高等研究院智能科学与技术学院2026年大学生暑期夏令营（线下）报名通知</span></a></p></td>\n<td><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/23f0c9972bc44d4c8874.png\"/></p><p><span>群号：1015238753</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>倪老师</span></p><p><span>0571-86085762</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p><strong><span>扫码进群即视作预报名成功，后续各学院确定夏令营举办具体信息后将正式发布报名链接，请及时关注群内消息以及各学院信息发布渠道</span></strong><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>五、</span><strong><span>往年夏令营精彩瞬间</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>（一）往年夏令营图片</span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span>院士讲座</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"FA86B\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/dff26a0fdfbd9e491fb4.png\"/></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/d4f38e89e28287b2225f.png\"/></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span>参观实验室并与科研人员面对面交流</span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/addc6079cc609445f574.png\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\"13246E\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/fd1862a2a1554bf75740.png\"/></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/54a933f3af6016a63868.png\"/></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span>营员合影</span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/ed90a7da3137c7f6e4cb.png\"/></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/7ca48632a2d8f12ff908.png\"/></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/c566c198bc3feeee47df.png\"/></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/df81c0e050ce4bfccf28.png\"/></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/57c17d620e91ef6f1a5d.png\"/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>（二）2025年夏令营微信公众号相关推文</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/1xYxwV39tdFNYxA2Iu7zNA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>格物筑梦<span></span>-基础物理与数学科学学院 2025年优秀大学生暑期夏令营圆满结束</span></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_Ts7lY2bHklpwKBJrfFpig\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>厚德载物<span></span> <span><span>明道有光</span> <span>—</span></span><span>物理与光电工程学院2025年优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动圆满成功</span></span></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/D9-9ADeg8mofnatJBu1s0w\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>这个夏天，我们在国科大<span></span>\"化\"梦想为现实</span></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/eFooh0VrPSlSqYpM4ylP8w\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>“生”命律动，“健”康护航，“科”学引路点亮未来之光！——生命学院2025年优秀大学生暑期夏令营圆满收官</span></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/FIktVI3eYSTS3VdTYpY_sw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>闻‘药’而来，满载而归！药物科学与技术学院2025年夏令营圆满结束</span></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/YqqqqQjLp1h3kfjILnLCAA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>国科大杭高院环境学院<span></span>2025年优秀大学生暑期夏令营圆满落幕</span></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/vDvGJZCX2omVM8ROmNzBFA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>“智创未来，智领世界”——国科大杭高院智能学院2025年优秀大学生夏令营活动圆满落幕</span></a></p>\n<p><span>六、</span><strong><span>关于杭高院的介绍</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>校友眼中的杭高院</span></strong><strong><span>：</span></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rY-7y4WsgFitz5YIkzNDNw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>首届校友来信，约你报考杭高院</span></a></p>\n<p><strong><span>杭高院招生宣传片：</span></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ve4y1E7Rg/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>值得研究</span><span> </span><span>| 来自国科大杭高院的招生宣传片</span></a></p>\n<p><strong><span>杭高院校园介绍：</span></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https